### interact-map — Test fixtures
### Requires VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### or any tool that supports .http files (IntelliJ HTTP Client, httpyac…)

@base = http://localhost:3333

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check — expect 200 { status: "ok" }
GET {{base}}/health

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NAVIGATION — Server-rendered pages (HTML)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard — expect 200 HTML with stat-cards
GET {{base}}/
Accept: text/html

###

### Applications inventory — expect 200 HTML, liste des applications du dataset
GET {{base}}/applications
Accept: text/html

###

### Services inventory — expect 200 HTML (PostgreSQL, Redis, Mailjet…)
GET {{base}}/services
Accept: text/html

###

### Servers inventory — expect 200 HTML (prod-vm-01)
GET {{base}}/servers
Accept: text/html

###

### Containers inventory — expect 200 HTML (orders-api)
GET {{base}}/containers
Accept: text/html

###

### Interactions inventory — expect 200 HTML (5 edges du dataset)
GET {{base}}/interactions
Accept: text/html

###

### Graph page — expect 200 HTML avec bandeau de stats + composant architecture-graph
GET {{base}}/graph
Accept: text/html

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FRAGMENTS Unpoly — HTML partials (simule les requêtes AJAX d'Unpoly)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Fragment applications — expect 200 HTML du partial inventory_table
GET {{base}}/fragments/inventory-applications
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #inventory-applications

###

### Fragment services — expect 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/fragments/inventory-services
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #inventory-services

###

### Fragment servers — expect 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/fragments/inventory-servers
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #inventory-servers

###

### Fragment containers — expect 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/fragments/inventory-containers
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #inventory-containers

###

### Fragment interactions — expect 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/fragments/inventory-interactions
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #inventory-interactions

###

### Fragment graph-summary — expect 200 HTML avec les compteurs de noeuds
GET {{base}}/fragments/graph-summary
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #graph-summary

###

### Fragment inconnu — expect 422 { error: "...", fallbackNavigation: "full_page" }
GET {{base}}/fragments/does-not-exist
Accept: text/html
X-Up-Target: #does-not-exist

