### Enregistrer un viewer — expect 201 { id, email, role }
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "securePassword123!",
  "role": "viewer"
}

###

### Enregistrer un editor — expect 201
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "securePassword123!",
  "role": "editor"
}

###

### Enregistrer un admin — expect 201
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@example.com",
  "password": "securePassword123!",
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### Email invalide — expect 422 validation error
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "securePassword123!",
  "role": "viewer"
}

###

### Rôle invalide — expect 422 validation error
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dave@example.com",
  "password": "abc",
  "role": "superuser"
}

###

### Lister tous les utilisateurs — expect 200 []
GET {{base}}/users/all

