### Logs d'audit — expect 200 [] ou liste d'entrées
GET {{base}}/audit/logs

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UPLOADS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Upload fichier docker-compose (multipart) — expect 200, merge + persist dans current-graph.json
POST {{base}}/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="production-compose.yml"
Content-Type: text/yaml

version: "3.8"
services:
  web:
    image: nginx:alpine
    ports: ["80:80"]
  api:
    image: acme/api:1.0
    ports: ["3333:3333"]
    depends_on: [web]
------boundary--

###

### Upload fichier docker-inspect (multipart + sourceType explicite) — expect 200
POST {{base}}/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary-inspect

------boundary-inspect
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sourceType"

docker-inspect
------boundary-inspect
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="schemaVersion"

1.0
------boundary-inspect
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="docker-inspect.json"
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "Id": "abc123",
    "Name": "/orders-api",
    "Config": {
      "Image": "acme/orders-api:1.12.0",
      "Env": ["REDIS_HOST=redis", "DB_HOST=postgres"]
    },
    "State": {
      "Status": "running"
    },
    "NetworkSettings": {
      "Networks": {
        "bridge": {}
      }
    }
  }
]
------boundary-inspect--

###

### Upload inline payload (JSON body) — expect 200
POST {{base}}/uploads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceType": "docker-ps",
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "payload": "[{\"ID\":\"abc123\",\"Names\":\"orders-api\",\"Image\":\"acme/orders-api:1.12.0\",\"State\":\"running\",\"Ports\":\"0.0.0.0:3333->3333/tcp\"}]"
}

